ault":"Mark Bremner"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"Caption 4","default":"CEO, MBKB Group"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"“They provide IT services for my 24 bed hotel, restaurant and newly refurbished sports bar and grill. Very responsive, knowledgeable and very reasonably priced. Special mention to Billy who never fails to pick up the phone.”"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"Caption 5","default":"JP"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"Bold text 3","default":"John Pringle"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"Caption 6","default":"CEO, The Portland Hotel Group"},{"k":"s19","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 8","default":"“Great managed IT service provider. Thank you WhizzIT for a smooth migration from Google to Microsoft 365. We really appreciate how professional Billy is, and he is always on hand to help us over the phone.”"},{"k":"s20","type":"s","label":"Caption 7","default":"AW"},{"k":"s21","type":"s","label":"Bold text 4","default":"Amy Welch"},{"k":"s22","type":"s","label":"Caption 8","default":"Director, Ixia Clinical"},{"k":"s23","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 9","default":"“WhizzIT are always on hand to support my construction company. Being able to simply pick up the phone and receive great IT support is an essential part of running my business.”"},{"k":"s24","type":"s","label":"Caption 9","default":"GH"},{"k":"s25","type":"s","label":"Bold text 5","default":"Gary Hufford"},{"k":"s26","type":"s","label":"Caption 10","default":"Owner, GH Building & Landscaping"},{"k":"s27","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 10","default":"“Amazing IT services. I am so happy I chose WhizzIT to help me with my new business set up. Very efficient and professional with great communication throughout.”"},{"k":"s28","type":"s","label":"Caption 11","default":"DP"},{"k":"s29","type":"s","label":"Bold text 6","default":"Daisy Pringle"},{"k":"s30","type":"s","label":"Caption 12","default":"Founder, DP Music"},{"k":"s31","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 11","default":"“Excellent service. Great insight and highly supportive. Thank you Billy.”"},{"k":"s32","type":"s","label":"Caption 13","default":"BW"},{"k":"s33","type":"s","label":"Bold text 7","default":"Ben Wilmot"},{"k":"s34","type":"s","label":"Caption 14","default":"Director, Canbury Insights"},{"k":"s35","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 12","default":"“Have been using this company for a few months and I couldn’t be happier. Very professional and reliable.”"},{"k":"s36","type":"s","label":"Caption 15","default":"BC"},{"k":"s37","type":"s","label":"Bold text 8","default":"Boris Carozzi"},{"k":"s38","type":"s","label":"Caption 16","default":"Procurement Manager, BF International"},{"k":"s39","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 13","default":"“Billy provides a superb service; responsive, attentive and very knowledgeable about IT.”"},{"k":"s40","type":"s","label":"Caption 17","default":"MT"},{"k":"s41","type":"s","label":"Bold text 9","default":"Matthew Temple"},{"k":"s42","type":"s","label":"Caption 18","default":"Director"},{"k":"s43","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 14","default":"“Billy gave me a wonderful service. I would recommend him highly.”"},{"k":"s44","type":"s","label":"Caption 19","default":"LJ"},{"k":"s45","type":"s","label":"Bold text 10","default":"Lady Julia Carter"},{"k":"s46","type":"s","label":"Caption 20","default":"Member, House of Lords"},{"k":"s47","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 15","default":"“Very helpful, friendly and efficient. Would recommend.”"},{"k":"s48","type":"s","label":"Caption 21","default":"KS"},{"k":"s49","type":"s","label":"Bold text 11","default":"Kim Saban"},{"k":"s50","type":"s","label":"Caption 22","default":"Google review"}]}